# The midpoint of a sliding ladder
sgp 2

construct
  point A on xaxis
  point B on yaxis
  segment AB
    d1: |AB| = 6
  C = mid(AB)

find
  d2: dist(O, C)

where
  A (4.8, 1.7234145588750292e-27)
  B (2.2978532092956548e-27, 3.6000000000000005)
  C (2.4, 1.8000000000000003)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d2 label (0.3, 0.3)
